  "description": "Local/offline high-quality text-to-speech for the Voxa pipeline using Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0) on ONNX Runtime, in-process. No API key, no network after the first-run model download. The quality tier of Voxa's local speech stack — speech that rivals commercial cloud voices, on your own CPU. Phonemization runs out-of-process (espeak-ng CLI per sentence); this package links no GPL code and must never reference KokoroSharp (which bundles espeak-ng natives).",
